{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12713","headline":"宿丹崖翁宅 · 元结","name":"宿丹崖翁宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扁舟欲到泷口湍，春水湍泷上水难。\n投竿来泊丹崖下，得与崖翁尽一欢。\n丹崖之亭当石颠，破竹半山引寒泉。\n泉流掩映在木杪，有若白鸟飞林间。\n往往随风作雾雨，湿人巾履满庭前。\n丹崖翁，爱丹崖，弃官几年崖下家。\n儿孙棹船抱酒瓮，醉里长歌挥钓车。\n吾将求退与翁游，学翁歌醉在鱼舟。\n官吏随人往未得，却望丹崖慙复羞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}